# Exclusion-based (REPO-BASELINE.md §1): a backend image build must not ship web/, tests/,
# docs/ and the infra tree as build context. Everything is excluded, then the .NET inputs
# are let back in. The web image builds from web/ as its own context and has its own ignore.
*
!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!WorkInPoland.sln
!src/WorkInPoland.ServiceDefaults/**
!src/WorkInPoland.Contracts/**
!src/WorkInPoland.Api/**
!src/WorkInPoland.AppHost/WorkInPoland.AppHost.csproj
!tests/WorkInPoland.Api.Tests/WorkInPoland.Api.Tests.csproj
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
